cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this archive, please cite both the article and the archive.
title: >-
  The price of computation: a canonical exchange-rate framework for AI model selection
abstract: >-
  Data and analysis code reproducing every number, table and figure in the
  article. The archive contains seven measurement corpora spanning image
  classification, object detection, semantic segmentation, speech recognition
  and language-model inference, together with the analysis pipeline that fits
  the quality-resource frontiers, estimates the canonical price, and runs the
  decision, transfer and robustness experiments.
